eval("__webpack_require__.r(__webpack_exports__);\n/* harmony export */ __webpack_require__.d(__webpack_exports__, {\n/* harmony export */   committeeMembers: () => (/* binding */ committeeMembers),\n/* harmony export */   getCommitteeMember: () => (/* binding */ getCommitteeMember)\n/* harmony export */ });\n/* harmony import */ var _siteImages__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__ = __webpack_require__(/*! ./siteImages */ \"(rsc)/./lib/siteImages.js\");\n\nconst committeeMembers = [\n    {\n        slug: \"trustee\",\n        name: \"Shri. Megeshyam Dattaram Khedekar\",\n        role: \"Trustee\",\n        marathiRole: \"विश्वस्त\",\n        marathiName: \"श्री. मेगाश्याम दत्ताराम खेडेकर\",\n        initials: \"01\",\n        image: (0,_siteImages__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__.getSiteImageUrl)(\"OUR PEOPLE/trustee.jpeg\"),\n        institution: \"Aai Ramai Devi Social Institution, Ghonse\",\n        paragraphs: [\n            \"Aai Ramai Devi Social Institution, Ghonse, is the result of the collective thoughts, unity and cooperation of all of us who have come together with the vision of bringing about the social, educational and overall development of our village. Started in the sacred name of Gramdevata Aai Ramai Devi, it is our heartfelt desire that this institution should become a strong platform that supports the weaker and underprivileged sections of society while ensuring that every individual in the village gets an opportunity to participate in the process of development.\",\n            \"As a Trustee, I firmly believe that the foundation of this institution must rest on four fundamental values—trust, transparency, honesty and social responsibility. It is our collective responsibility to ensure that every donation and contribution received by the institution is utilised properly, responsibly and transparently, so that the maximum possible benefit reaches society.\",\n            \"Through this institution, we will make sincere efforts to undertake long-term, sustainable and meaningful work in various fields such as education, healthcare, sports, women and child development, environmental conservation, agriculture, preservation of cultural heritage and social service.\",\n            \"This institution has been established in the name of our revered Gramdevata, Aai Ramai Devi. Therefore, every office-bearer and member is expected to discharge their responsibilities selflessly, honestly and with a spirit of service. The interests, objectives and social responsibilities of the institution must always be given priority over personal differences and individual interests.\",\n            \"Today, we are laying the foundation stone of this institution; however, tomorrow, our work should create a capable, transparent and exemplary social platform for the generations to come. My sincere resolve is that the institution we are building today should not remain limited to our generation, but should become a valuable social legacy for future generations.\",\n            \"With the blessings of Aai Ramai Devi, the cooperation of everyone and our collective unity, may this institution continue to work with dedication for the welfare of society and make a meaningful contribution to the development of Ghonse village. This is my heartfelt prayer and sincere resolve.\"\n        ]\n    },\n    {\n        slug: \"president\",\n        name: \"Shri. Santosh Waman Kate\",\n        role: \"President\",\n        marathiRole: \"अध्यक्ष\",\n        marathiName: \"श्री. संतोष वामन काते\",\n        initials: \"02\",\n        image: (0,_siteImages__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__.getSiteImageUrl)(\"OUR PEOPLE/President.jpeg\"),\n        institution: \"Aai Ramai Educational and Social Institution\",\n        paragraphs: [\n            \"Aai Ramai Educational and Social Institution has been established with the vision of contributing to the development of our village and promoting the overall progress and welfare of every section of society. Our institution is committed to bringing together the citizens of our village and working collectively in various fields such as social welfare, education, healthcare, sports, culture, environmental conservation, and the development of women and children.\",\n            \"This institution does not belong to any individual or to a select few. It is an institution of the entire village and for the entire village. Our primary objective is to ensure that assistance reaches every deserving person through the institution, to provide proper educational encouragement and guidance to the youth, and to undertake constructive initiatives for the overall development of the village.\",\n            \"Transparency, trust, discipline, and a proper decision-making process are of utmost importance in every activity undertaken by the institution. A position within the institution is not merely a matter of honour or recognition; it carries with it a responsibility. We expect every office-bearer and member to perform their duties with this sense of responsibility and commitment.\",\n            \"The institution cannot function successfully without the cooperation and support of all. Therefore, with the trust and participation of the senior citizens, the enthusiasm of the youth, women, students, and every villager, let us work together to make this institution stronger, more effective, and an exemplary organisation.\",\n            \"With the blessings of Aai Ramai Devi, our firm resolve is to contribute to the development of the village by working selflessly, continuously, and with dedication. Through collective efforts and unity, we aspire to create meaningful and lasting progress for our community.\",\n            \"For the institution to grow, the society it serves must grow through the institution.\"\n        ]\n    },\n    {\n        slug: \"secretary\",\n        name: \"Shri. Sagar Keshav Khedekar\",\n        role: \"Secretary\",\n        marathiRole: \"सचिव\",\n        initials: \"03\",\n        image: (0,_siteImages__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__.getSiteImageUrl)(\"OUR PEOPLE/secretary.jpeg\"),\n        paragraphs: [\n            \"Aai Ramai Social Institution, Ghonse, is a symbol of our unity, service, and social responsibility. Keeping in mind the needs and concerns of every family, youth, woman, student, and senior citizen in our village, we have collectively envisioned working towards the overall development and welfare of our community.\",\n            \"As the Secretary, my role is not limited merely to overseeing the administrative functioning of the institution. My responsibility is to ensure proper coordination among all office-bearers and members so that the institution’s objectives, policies, plans, and every initiative are implemented effectively and in an organised manner.\",\n            \"Special emphasis will be placed on transparency, discipline, responsibility, and proper time management in all the activities of the institution. We are committed to maintaining proper records of every decision taken by the institution, planning and documenting various activities, preparing reports, and ensuring that accurate and relevant information reaches all members of the institution in a timely manner.\",\n            \"Through our institution, we aim to undertake concrete and long-term initiatives in the fields of education, healthcare, sports, women and child development, environmental conservation, agriculture, culture, and social service.\",\n            \"In my opinion, the true strength of an institution does not lie merely in its office-bearers, but in every member who is sincerely and faithfully connected with the institution and its vision. Therefore, let us all set aside our individual differences and work together with unity and dedication towards achieving the objectives of the institution.\",\n            \"With the blessings of Aai Ramai Devi and the cooperation of everyone, I am fully confident that this institution will remain dedicated to the welfare and development of our village and, through its work, establish itself as an exemplary social institution in the district.\"\n        ]\n    },\n    {\n        slug: \"treasurer\",\n        name: \"Shri. Tejas Dipak Darge\",\n        role: \"Treasurer\",\n        marathiRole: \"खजिनदार\",\n        marathiName: \"श्री. तेजस दीपक दर्गे\",\n        initials: \"04\",\n        image: (0,_siteImages__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__.getSiteImageUrl)(\"OUR PEOPLE/treasurer.jpeg\"),\n        institution: \"Aai Ramai Social and Educational Institution\",\n        paragraphs: [\n            \"As the Treasurer, I would like to express my views regarding the financial, educational, and welfare-related activities of the institution.\",\n            \"Aai Ramai Social and Educational Institution has been established with the objective of working towards the development of the weaker and underprivileged sections of society, as well as in the areas of education, healthcare, women’s welfare, and social awareness. Through the institution, we intend to undertake various social and educational initiatives for the overall development and welfare of the community.\",\n            \"As the Treasurer, it will be my primary responsibility to maintain transparency, honesty, and accountability in all financial transactions of the institution. I will always make sincere efforts to ensure that all financial dealings are conducted properly and transparently, in accordance with the objectives of the institution and all applicable rules and regulations.\",\n            \"With the cooperation and support of all office-bearers, members, and well-wishers of the institution, I am fully confident that we will successfully achieve our objective of serving and upholding the values of Aai Ramai Devi and working towards the progress and welfare of society.\",\n            \"With transparency in our actions, honesty in our intentions, and unity in our efforts, we can build an institution that truly serves society.\"\n        ]\n    },\n    {\n        slug: \"ravish-mahadik\",\n        name: \"Ravish Shantaram Mahadik\",\n        role: \"Chairperson, Cultural Coordination Committee\",\n        marathiRole: \"अध्यक्ष, सांस्कृतिक समन्वय समिती\",\n        marathiName: \"रवीश शांताराम महाडिक\",\n        initials: \"05\",\n        image: (0,_siteImages__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__.getSiteImageUrl)(\"OUR PEOPLE/Ravi.jpeg\"),\n        institution: \"Aai Ramai Devi Social Institution, Ghonse\",\n        paragraphs: [\n            \"The cultural identity of our village is deeply connected to its traditions, people, and shared memories. As the chairperson of the Cultural Coordination Committee, I believe it is our responsibility to preserve those values while also helping the younger generation stay connected to them.\",\n            \"Our committee will work to encourage participation in cultural events, community celebrations, and local traditions that bring people together in a spirit of unity and respect. Through these efforts, we can build stronger social bonds and create a sense of pride in our shared heritage.\",\n            \"Culture is not just about tradition—it is also about responsibility, harmony, and collective growth. By creating a space where every villager can participate, we can strengthen our identity and deepen our social commitment.\",\n            \"With the support of the community and the blessings of Aai Ramai Devi, we will work sincerely to keep our culture alive, meaningful, and rooted in service.\"\n        ]\n    },\n    {\n        slug: \"ratish-mahadik\",\n        name: \"Ratish Shantaram Mahadik\",\n        role: \"Chairperson, Fund Collection & Coordination Committee\",\n        marathiRole: \"अध्यक्ष, निधी संकलन आणि समन्वय समिती\",\n        marathiName: \"रतिश शांताराम महाडीक\",\n        initials: \"06\",\n        image: (0,_siteImages__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__.getSiteImageUrl)(\"OUR PEOPLE/Ritesh.jpeg\"),\n        institution: \"Aai Ramai Devi Social Institution, Ghonse\",\n        paragraphs: [\n            \"The success of any social initiative depends on stability, planning, and trust. As the chairperson of the Fund Collection and Coordination Committee, I believe it is our duty to ensure that every contribution is collected transparently and directed to meaningful community work.\",\n            \"Our aim is to build a spirit of responsibility in every citizen so that donations, support, and volunteer efforts come together for the benefit of the village and its people. We also need to coordinate efforts so that every programme is well planned and reaches the intended beneficiaries.\",\n            \"Financial support is important, but the values behind it matter even more—honesty, accountability, and social responsibility. When these values guide us, our work becomes stronger and more sustainable.\",\n            \"With the support of all members and well-wishers, we will work to create a disciplined and transparent system that supports development with dignity and purpose.\"\n        ]\n    },\n    {\n        slug: \"pranit-mahadik\",\n        name: \"Pranit Mahadik\",\n        role: \"Chairperson, Social Media & Environmental Coordination Committee\",\n        marathiRole: \"अध्यक्ष, सोशल मीडिया आणि पर्यावरण समन्वय समिती\",\n        marathiName: \"प्रणित महाडिक\",\n        initials: \"07\",\n        image: (0,_siteImages__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__.getSiteImageUrl)(\"OUR PEOPLE/Pranit.jpeg\"),\n        institution: \"Aai Ramai Devi Social Institution, Ghonse\",\n        paragraphs: [\n            \"In the present age, awareness and communication are essential tools for social change. As the chairperson of the Social Media and Environmental Coordination Committee, I see it as our responsibility to connect the community with important information, positive action, and sustainable practices.\",\n            \"Our work will involve spreading awareness about development, health, education, and social responsibility, while also encouraging the community to protect nature and preserve the environment. Digital outreach can help us mobilise support, but our real strength lies in the active participation of the people.\",\n            \"Environmental protection is not a separate issue—it is deeply connected to health, livelihoods, and the future of our children. By working together, we can create awareness and bring real change in daily life, village habits, and community action.\",\n            \"With unity, clarity, and sincerity, we will use both communication and environmental action to build a cleaner, healthier, and more informed village community.\"\n        ]\n    },\n    {\n        slug: \"rupesh-manjrekar\",\n        name: \"Rupesh Nathuram Manjrekar\",\n        role: \"Chairperson, Sports Coordination Committee\",\n        marathiRole: \"अध्यक्ष, क्रीडा समन्वय समिती\",\n        marathiName: \"रुपेश नथुराम मांजरेकर\",\n        initials: \"08\",\n        image: (0,_siteImages__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__.getSiteImageUrl)(\"OUR PEOPLE/Rupesh.jpeg\"),\n        institution: \"Aai Ramai Devi Social Institution, Ghonse\",\n        paragraphs: [\n            \"Sport is a powerful means of instilling discipline, confidence, and teamwork. As the chairperson of the Sports Coordination Committee, I believe it is important to encourage youth participation in physical activity and village-level sports development.\",\n            \"A strong sports culture helps build character, improves health, and strengthens community unity. Through organised training, participation, and support, we can create a platform where every young person gets an opportunity to grow and represent the village with pride.\",\n            \"Our goal is not only to identify talent but also to promote discipline, respect, and a healthy lifestyle. A community that supports its youth through sport builds a stronger future for everyone.\",\n            \"With the support of the village and the institution, we will continue to encourage sports as a path to health, confidence, and social development.\"\n        ]\n    },\n    {\n        slug: \"sudesh-kate\",\n        name: \"Sudesh Kate\",\n        role: \"Chairperson, Health & Wellness Committee\",\n        marathiRole: \"अध्यक्ष, आरोग्य सन्मान समिती\",\n        marathiName: \"सुदेश काते\",\n        initials: \"09\",\n        image: (0,_siteImages__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__.getSiteImageUrl)(\"OUR PEOPLE/Sudhesh.jpeg\"),\n        institution: \"Aai Ramai Devi Social Institution, Ghonse\",\n        paragraphs: [\n            \"Good health is the foundation of a strong and productive life. As the chairperson of the Health and Wellness Committee, I believe the institution must continue to promote awareness, preventive care, and healthy living in the village.\",\n            \"Our work will focus on creating awareness about hygiene, sanitation, disease prevention, and the importance of regular health care. We must also make support available to those who need it so that health becomes a basic right and not a privilege.\",\n            \"A healthy village is a progressive village. By bringing together families, youth, and local volunteers, we can create a stronger culture of care, responsibility, and well-being for everyone.\",\n            \"With the cooperation of the community and the blessings of Aai Ramai Devi, we will continue to work for a healthier and more conscious village.\"\n        ]\n    },\n    {\n        slug: \"vrushal-darge\",\n        name: \"Vrushal Rajaram Darge\",\n        role: \"Chairperson, Community Development & Coordination\",\n        marathiRole: \"अध्यक्ष, समुदाय विकास आणि समन्वय\",\n        marathiName: \"वृषाल राजाराम दर्गे\",\n        initials: \"10\",\n        image: (0,_siteImages__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__.getSiteImageUrl)(\"OUR PEOPLE/Vrushal.jpeg\"),\n        institution: \"Aai Ramai Devi Social Institution, Ghonse\",\n        paragraphs: [\n            \"The strength of a village lies in the active participation of its people. As a committee chairperson, I believe the path of development becomes stronger when every citizen feels connected to the mission and contributes with sincerity.\",\n            \"Our responsibility is to ensure that initiatives are implemented with coordination, discipline, and care. By working together across committee responsibilities, we can build a village that is more united, informed, and capable.\",\n            \"Development does not happen through speeches alone—it grows through consistent community action. When we combine effort, awareness, and compassion, even small steps can lead to meaningful change.\",\n            \"With the support of the village and the trust of the institution, we will continue to work for collective progress and social responsibility.\"\n        ]\n    }\n];\nfunction getCommitteeMember(slug) {\n    return committeeMembers.find((member)=>member.slug === slug);\n}\n//# sourceURL=[module]\n//# sourceMappingURL=data:application/json;charset=utf-8;base64,\n//# sourceURL=webpack-internal:///(rsc)/./lib/committeeMembers.js\n");

